### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Agent roster without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/agents?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC

### Agent roster for a non-owner wallet must be 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/agents?walletPubkey=YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Agent roster for the owner: NEXUS = Pedagogical (bits 1), GENESIS = Onboarding, 5 permission bits
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/agents?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Build authorize_agent: NEXUS wallet gets 0x01 (owner signs next in the wallet)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/agents/authorize/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "agentCode": "NEXUS",
  "agentWalletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU",
  "permissions": 1
}

### Unknown permission bit 0x20 must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/agents/authorize/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "agentCode": "NEXUS",
  "agentWalletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU",
  "permissions": 32
}

### Forged confirm: the init_treasury signature (not authorize_agent) must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/agents/authorize/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "agentCode": "NEXUS",
  "agentWalletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU",
  "permissions": 1,
  "txSignature": "57HQdQXw5KakRBWEqa9kSStuEZant4dqNdTMX4toHLJQUW9QdpfWZYTgiDioNNSgppkRndG8Lzx4j7p2UnEZrjoi"
}

### Level console for a wallet without a live 0x01 authorization must be 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agents/level/musicians?walletPubkey=U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Level console for the owner (owner keeps every agent power): musicians with wallets
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agents/level/musicians?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Build update_musician_level as owner: agentAuthority account = program id (Anchor None)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agents/level/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "newLevel": 3
}

### Level 6 is out of range: 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agents/level/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "newLevel": 6
}

### Enroll ignores any client level (stored at level 0); lowercase country must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/musicians
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 1,
  "enigmaLevelId": 6,
  "countryCode": "mex"
}
